t":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"5xRmemqmR89BpGoOA25hqA","review_id":"qc-og8bez15b8iR-mE6PJg","date":"2019-02-05T17:45:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9380956888198853,"text_excerpt":"This is the best Chinese restaurant in New Orleans and frankly I could leave it at that but let's dig in. I went on a Sunday afternoon right as they were opening (3pm) with a large group (7). We arrived around 2:40 and there was already a line forming. We were seated right away and the service was attentive but chaotic. We ordered everything at once basically but it came out sporadically. The dishes we got (and my opinion) *Five Spice Fried Pork Ribs - fine, could use more spice to cut through the grease *Salt & Pepper Squid - same as above *Xiao Long Bao - very good *Crabmeat and Crawfish Bao - not as good as the xiao long bao but a really great local take on the dish. Will surely become..."},{"business_id":"5xRmemqmR89BpGoOA25hqA","review_id":"pVUwI3WhLGP0OmPyg4Ak-A","date":"2019-12-14T05:02:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9369626045227051,"text_excerpt":"Honestly probably the best Asian restaurant I've had since moving to New Orleans! We had their xiao long bao, popcorn chicken, combo fried rice, chicken crepe, garlic string beans, crab and crawfish bao, and spicy wontons. The combo fried rice was fine--not bad but nothing remarkable. I would get it again though as an easy stomach filler. Garlic string beans are hard to mess up so they were fine as well. Chicken crepe was pretty good, as was the crab and crawfish bao. My three favorites which I would definitely recommend are the spicy wontons, popcorn chicken, and xiao long bao. I'm for sure getting all three again next time I come back. The location itself is pretty small, but I like the..."},{"business_id":"5xRmemqmR89BpGoOA25hqA","review_id":"jYsGK2AUZwBtCAnxd9Ecvg","date":"2019-06-05T02:35:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9357825517654419,"text_excerpt":"This place has really good Chinese food. Their xiao long bao is why we came but we stayed for their crabmeat and crawfish bao. I thoroughly enjoy their basil chicken. Their wonton in spicy sauce is ok. Not as great as we expected but I enjoyed the sauce it came with. I plan to come back and try more of their food to give a more in-depth analysis of their menu."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"5xRmemqmR89BpGoOA25hqA","photo_id":"sJS2xMIwPa8o3oU6IPQ4Gg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/sJS2xMIwPa8o3oU6IPQ4Gg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8722852468490601},{"business_id":"5xRmemqmR89BpGoOA25hqA","photo_id":"Lg_QX16l09zpnxXGuqaZJQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Lg_QX16l09zpnxXGuqaZJQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8262734413146973},{"business_id":"5xRmemqmR89BpGoOA25hqA","photo_id":"qvenTki0nk7ZVyPACNKwaQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/qvenTki0nk7ZVyPACNKwaQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8218257427215576},{"business_id":"5xRmemqmR89BpGoOA25hqA","photo_id":"B7OACzXZXXkZvpvro479Ng","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/B7OACzXZXXkZvpvro479Ng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7893062829971313},{"business_id":"5xRmemqmR89BpGoOA25hqA","photo_id":"gO99FH8PoPxCGROUEm1CVg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/gO99FH8PoPxCGROUEm1CVg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7758336067199707}]},"n